# Data provenance

The **one tracked pointer** to every input this study does not compute — **none of the data itself is in git.** Raw inputs live in `sourcedata/`, which is git-ignored. State exactly where every input comes from, name the **true upstream source** (never a derived intermediate), give the exact fetch and regenerate steps, and mark which quantities are **sourced** and which are **synthesised**.

A study that computes all of its own inputs says so here in one line and stops. That is a complete provenance record, not an empty one.

